msgid "Database Search Defaults"
msgstr "資料庫搜尋預設值"

msgid "Enable this module for a best-practice default setup of Search API with the Database backend. After installation it is recommended to uninstall this module again for performance reasons. The provided configuration will not be removed."
msgstr "啟用此模組，是以「資料庫」後端進行「搜尋 API」預設安裝的最佳作法。 安裝之後，基於效能考量，建議您再次解除安裝此模組。 將不會移除提供的配置。"

msgid "Search"
msgstr "搜尋"

